[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2974907934","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107570#issuecomment-2974907934","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107570","id":2974907934,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xUX4e","user":{"login":"JoNax97","id":10124534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTI0NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10124534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97","html_url":"https://github.com/JoNax97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T02:13:07Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T02:13:07Z","body":"I'm concerned that this will create too many similar but not-quite-the-same options for resource sharing.\r\n\r\nWe already have `local to scene` and `make unique`. These are different enough that most people can grasp them without much trouble. If we add this new `shared copy` option, I feel new users will have a hard time understanding the nuances and when to use which one.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2974907934/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2975075030","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107570#issuecomment-2975075030","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107570","id":2975075030,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xVArW","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T04:35:52Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T04:35:52Z","body":"@JoNax97 \r\nLooking at the proposals I mentioned, if we want a solution that even new users can understand at first glance, it will likely be this: godotengine/godot-proposals#9603, but after reading the conversation you can see, it'll run into other UX issues:\r\n  1. The node could be duplicated while in Script view mode\r\n  2. Duplicate is used so often that the window will virtually be pinned there \r\n\r\nThen a full-blown pop-up window for every node duplication is suggested, but people disagree with that for good reasons.\r\n\r\nSo I stick with godotengine/godot-proposals#4672, which suggested we should **have good defaults when copying resources** (shared or full copy).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n> I'm concerned that this will create too many similar but not-quite-the-same options for resource sharing.\r\n\r\nYou are right about this, although they are in fact functionally different now. Another thought is we can replace ```local_to_scene``` by ```shared_copy```, and we leave only this option. Then ```shared_copy``` can be used both in node duplication and scene instantiation.\r\n\r\n> If we add this new `shared copy` option, I feel new users will have a hard time understanding the nuances and when to use which one.\r\n\r\nI disagree with this.\r\n\r\nMost people that discuss this UX issue should have moderate experience with Godot engine, and we might forget the time when we are new users to Godot. I personally, looked into the option ```local_to_scene``` **only after I run into issues**.\r\n\r\nIf we have good defaults, I don't think it'll confuse new users, as they will just leave it be if there's no problem about it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2975075030/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2975111130","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107570#issuecomment-2975111130","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107570","id":2975111130,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xVJfa","user":{"login":"seppoday","id":62170071,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMTcwMDcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62170071?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday","html_url":"https://github.com/seppoday","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T05:02:29Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T05:03:06Z","body":"Maybe property should be called Copy (or Duplicate) with 2 options Shared and Full. With Shared as default?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2975111130/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2975895013","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107570#issuecomment-2975895013","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107570","id":2975895013,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xYI3l","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T09:57:36Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T14:05:39Z","body":"> Maybe property should be called Copy (or Duplicate) with 2 options Shared and Full. With Shared as default?\r\n\r\nI'd thought of making this option as a drop down **Copy Mode: [Shared, Full]** before. It should indicate what this does more obviously. My concern is I can't think of a possibility for a third option to appear, is it redundant to make it a drop down?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2975895013/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"duplicate"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3016022288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107570#issuecomment-3016022288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107570","id":3016022288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zxNkQ","user":{"login":"SanNull","id":124409014,"node_id":"U_kgDOB2pUtg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124409014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull","html_url":"https://github.com/SanNull","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-28T20:41:01Z","updated_at":"2025-06-28T20:41:01Z","body":"\n> We already have `local to scene` and `make unique`. These are different enough that most people can grasp them without much trouble. If we add this new `shared copy` option, I feel new users will have a hard time understanding the nuances and when to use which one.\n> \n\nImo even these two are quite confusing, `local_to_scene` is more used for runtime instances, but also works for editor instances. At the end of the day, they end up doing the same thing. I think a preferable option would be to unify these options, but it's far out of scope for this PR\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3016022288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3157592096","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107570#issuecomment-3157592096","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107570","id":3157592096,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68NQgg","user":{"login":"SanNull","id":124409014,"node_id":"U_kgDOB2pUtg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124409014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull","html_url":"https://github.com/SanNull","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T06:39:46Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T06:40:55Z","body":"Maybe a more succinct approach would be to change `local_to_scene` to be applicable to duplicated Nodes as well, and also rename it 'unique_to_node' as KoBeWi and Fire [mentioned here their differences](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/editor?msg=y7gNqo7NvdxL5Lka8)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3157592096/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3762655055","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107570#issuecomment-3762655055","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107570","id":3762655055,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gRY9P","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/or